<title>AUSTRALIA: Matrix to raise A$48.6 mln in 1-for-2 issue.</title>
<headline>Matrix to raise A$48.6 mln in 1-for-2 issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian paging group Matrix Telecommunications Ltd said it would raise A$48.6 million through a one-for-two renounceable right issue at A$0.80 a share.</p>
</text>
